note right of AIService
  Uses Google Gemini API
  Integrates with DataCacheService
  Supports force refresh
end note

note right of PreloadService
  Singleton pattern
  Preloads AI analysis in background
  Prevents multiple simultaneous preloads
end note

@enduml
